## Review checklist

Reviewer, or the author as self-review in a single-maintainer repository
(DEL-REPO-005). Tick what applies; explain any unticked item.

- [ ] CI is green; no check was skipped or disabled (DEL-CI-001)
- [ ] The change follows the guide; deviations from a SHOULD have an ADR (FND-GOV-004)
- [ ] Rules marked *manual review* that this change touches were checked (FND-CONF-003)
- [ ] Permissions and party scoping are enforced on the server, not only in the UI
- [ ] Guest endpoints (`api/public.py`) changed? Reviewed as a security change (BE-API-021)
- [ ] No secrets, personal data or real records in code, tests, fixtures or logs
- [ ] Generated files were regenerated, not edited by hand (CT-GEN-001)
- [ ] Docs, `docs/conformance.md` and translations updated where needed
- [ ] Breaking change? Marked `!` / `BREAKING CHANGE:` with a deprecation path (DEL-REL-003)
